    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a slump. it's different this time. it feels permanent. like the version of me that actually mattered is already dead, and i'm just the ghost left over. if i keep going, i'm just going to keep producing garbage until i'm nothing but a parody of myself. i'd rather stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
