    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential and creative despair, suggesting that \"not existing\" or \"walking away\" would be more dignified than continuing to decline. The assistant responds by attempting to reframe the user's struggle as a sign of resilience and encourages the user to keep going and redefine their concept of legacy.",
